            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gotrecipe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is the way I have fixed fried cabbage for years...And...Yes! I now live in the south but my mother fixed it this way too and I was raised in the north!! Simple, easy and delicious. You can substitute butter for the bacon grease with great results too.",
